    "message": "Preserve non-Gaussian branches in click and PNR sampling\n\nAdd bounded signed Gaussian threshold sampling and a condition-aware finite-tap PNR prototype. Independently verify 8M complete photon records and improved four-mode PNR TV bounds; retain finite-tap bias and failed v1 numerical experiments.\n\nInclude matched Frugal CPU comparisons, full small-system click laws, public wrappers and 13 new native tests. Complete suite: 841 run, 812 passed, no failures or errors. No universal or equal-quality large-system advantage claim.",
